@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Crear cliente
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "María Fernanda López",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-20",
  "gender": "Female",
  "monthlyIncome": 2500.50
}

### 2. Crear cuenta (reemplaza el customerId por el obtenido arriba)
POST {{host}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "initialBalance": 100.00
}

### 3. Consultar saldo (reemplaza el número de cuenta)
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-20260101-0000/balance

### 4. Depósito
POST {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-20260101-0000/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 50.00 }

### 5. Retiro
POST {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-20260101-0000/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 30.00 }

### 6. Historial
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-20260101-0000/transactions
